menu "upload_auth: /scripts upload authentication (DESIGN.md §10)"

    config UPLOAD_AUTH_HMAC_KEY
        string "Shared HMAC secret for /scripts/* uploads (empty disables auth entirely)"
        default ""
        help
            If empty (the default), upload authentication is not wired in
            at all - no nonce endpoint is registered and /scripts/* accepts
            uploads exactly as if this component didn't exist, fine for a
            trusted-LAN deployment (DESIGN.md §1). Set this to a secret
            shared with the uploader to require a valid nonce + HMAC-SHA256
            signature on every script upload.

endmenu
